        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ਉਲਝਣਾ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਉਲਝਣਾ — ulajhṇā — \"to get tangled; to get muddled\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਮੈਂ ਲੰਮੇ ਸਵਾਲਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਨਹੀਂ ਉਲਝਦਾ ਹਾਂ। maiṁ lamme savālāṁ vich nahīṁ ulajhdā hāṁ. I don't get muddled by long questions."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ਮੈਂ ਸਵਾਲ ਵਿੱਚ ਉਲਝਿਆ, maiṁ savāl vich uljhiā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਉਲਝਣਾ (ulajhṇā) is inherited from Sanskrit uparundhati, \"obstructs\"; CDIAL lists Punjabi uljhaṇā, \"to be entangled\", under it (CDIAL 2221)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for asking and answering."
